"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"trunk"},{"surface":"கள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"கள்ளி","lemma":"கள்ளி","gloss":"spurge cactus"}],"gloss":"spurge cactus"},{"surface":"விரி","parts":[{"text":"விரி","lemma":"விரி","gloss":"spreading"}],"gloss":"spreading"},{"surface":"காய்","parts":[{"text":"காய்","lemma":"காய்","gloss":"fruit"}],"gloss":"fruit"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"கவட்டு","parts":[{"text":"கவட்டு","lemma":"கவட்டு","gloss":"fork of a branch"}],"gloss":"fork of a branch","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தயங்க","parts":[{"text":"தயங்கு","lemma":"தயங்கு","gloss":"sway"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to sway"},{"surface":"விருந்து","parts":[{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"இருந்து","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"having sat"}],"gloss":"having sat"},{"surface":"புலம்ப","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"lament"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to lament"},{"surface":"கூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"கூஉம்","lemma":"கூஉம்","gloss":"that calls"}],"gloss":"that calls","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருஞ்சுர","parts":[{"text":"அருஞ்சுர","lemma":"அருஞ்சுர","gloss":"difficult desert"}],"gloss":"difficult desert","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வைப்பில்","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"வைப்பு","gloss":"region"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"in"}],"gloss":"in the region"},{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிரிந்து","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்து","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"having parted"}],"gloss":"having parted"},{"surface":"சேண்","parts":[{"text":"சேண்","lemma":"சேண்","gloss":"far away"}],"gloss":"far away"},{"surface":"உறைதல்","parts":[{"text":"உறைதல்","lemma":"உறைதல்","gloss":"living"}],"gloss":"living","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வல்லுவோரே","parts":[{"text":"வல்லுவோர்","lemma":"வல்லுநர்","gloss":"those who are capable"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"those who are capable indeed"}]}],"literal":"How did they know, O friend, of snake / sloughed skin stretched-like heat shimmering season / wrinkled prey desiring rose male bird thinking of / spotted feathered neck short walking female bird / scarred trunk spurge cactus spreading fruit beautiful fork / to sway sitting to lament calls out / harsh desert region wilderness / parting far away living those who are capable indeed","translation":"How did he know, my friend, and manage to live so far away, parting from me? In the harsh desert wilderness, during the season of shimmering heat that looks like the stretched-out sloughed skin of a snake, a short-stepping female dove with a spotted-feathered neck sits on the beautiful fork of a spurge cactus with scarred trunks and spreading fruit, swaying as she laments and calls out, thinking of her male mate who flew up in search of wrinkled prey.","modern":"தோழியே! பாம்பின் உரிந்துபோன தோல் நீண்டு கிடப்பது போல வெயில் கொதிக்கும் இக்காலத்தில், தன் ஆண் துணையை நினைத்து, புள்ளிகள் உள்ள கழுத்தையும் மெல்லிய நடையையும் உடைய பெண் புறா ஒன்று, வரிகள் விழுந்த தண்டுடைய கள்ளிச் செடியின் அழகான கிளையில் அமர்ந்து, அக்கிளை அசையும்படி வருத்தத்துடன் கூவுகிறது. இத்தகைய அரிய பாலைநிலக் காட்டில் நம்மைப் பிரிந்து தொலைதூரத்தில் தங்கியிருக்க அவரால் எப்படி முடிகிறது?","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her friend during the hot season of separation. The hero has gone to a distant land to earn wealth, traversing the harsh desert (pālai) landscape. The heroine wonders how he has the strength of heart to stay away in such a desolate place. The shimmering heat of the desert is compared to the stretched-out sloughed skin of a snake. The image of the lonely female dove calling out for her mate from a dry spurge cactus mirrors the heroine's own state of longing and grief. Key words include 'உருப்பு' (heat), 'கள்ளி' (cactus), and 'வல்லுவோரே' (those who are capable).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.09,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.7],[2.7,3.02],[3.17,3.7],[3.7,4.13],[4.13,4.55],[4.55,4.98],[4.98,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.3],[6.53,6.99],[6.99,7.44],[7.44,7.9],[7.9,8.25],[8.43,8.6],[8.6,9.2],[9.2,10.01],[10.01,10.47],[10.47,11.0],[11.0,11.73],[11.86,12.1],[12.1,12.82],[13.0,13.4],[13.4,13.85],[13.85,14.6],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,15.64],[15.64,15.9]],"female":[[0.11,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.04],[3.04,3.42],[3.42,4.03],[4.03,4.53],[4.53,4.9],[5.18,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.7],[6.7,7.22],[7.22,7.74],[7.74,8.26],[8.26,8.47],[8.47,9.25],[9.25,9.84],[9.84,10.43],[10.43,11.8],[11.8,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.3],[13.3,13.5],[13.5,14.46],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,15.6],[15.6,16.26],[16.52,16.9],[16.9,17.27],[17.27,17.5]]},"sync":[[["யாங்கு","how"],["அறிந்தனர்","they knew"]],[["அறிந்தனர்","they knew"],["கொல்","particle of doubt"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["பாம்பின்","of the snake"]],[["உரிநிமிர்ந்",""]],[["தன்ன",""]],[["உருப்பவி",""]],[["ரமையத்",""]],[["திரை","wrinkled prey"],["வேட்டு","desiring"]],[["வேட்டு","desiring"],["எழுந்த","that rose"]],[["சேவல்","male bird"]],[["உள்ளி","thinking of"]],[["பொறி","spots"],["மயிர்","feathers"]],[["எருத்தின்","of the neck"]],[["குறு","short"],["நடை","gait"],["பேடை","female bird"]],[["பேடை","female bird"]],[["பொறி","scarred"],["கால்","trunk"]],[["கள்ளி","spurge cactus"]],[["விரி","spreading"],["காய்","fruit"]],[["காய்","fruit"],["அம்","beautiful"],["கவட்டு","fork of a branch"]],[["தயங்க","to sway"]],[["விருந்து","having sat"]],[["புலம்ப","to lament"],["கூஉம்","that calls"]],[["கூஉம்","that calls"]],[["அருஞ்சுர","difficult desert"]],[["வைப்பில்","in the region"]],[["கானம்","forest"]],[["பிரிந்து","having parted"],["சேண்","far away"]],[["சேண்","far away"],["உறைதல்","living"]],[["வல்லுவோரே","those who are capable indeed"]],[["வல்லுவோரே","those who are capable indeed"]]]}